WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.100
This is what South Korea is better at than Japan.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.741
Literally everything is cheaper. Food,

00:00:03.742 --> 00:00:04.861
transportation, shopping,

00:00:04.862 --> 00:00:06.781
even hotels are much cheaper than in Japan.

00:00:06.782 --> 00:00:07.821
It's much more modern.

00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:10.021
Korea is ahead in daily tech and new technologies.

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:11.901
It's more card friendly and way more convenient.

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:14.101
It's less crowded, you don't have to wait in long lines

00:00:14.102 --> 00:00:15.821
or book attractions months in advance.

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:17.501
Better Wi Fi and mobile internet.

00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:20.181
Korea's internet is famously fast and you can find Wi Fi everywhere.

00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:21.821
Japan's internet is still a bit behind.

00:00:21.822 --> 00:00:23.621
Public transportation is much easier.

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:25.061
The sole metro is one system.

00:00:25.062 --> 00:00:26.701
Super logical and easier to navigate.

00:00:26.702 --> 00:00:28.661
There are no major natural disasters in Korea,

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:30.581
so you can feel safer. More English friendly.

00:00:30.582 --> 00:00:32.461
Even though most Koreans don't speak English,

00:00:32.462 --> 00:00:34.501
there are more places with English menus and translation.

00:00:34.502 --> 00:00:36.701
The vibe is lighter, people talk to you more,

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.461
and it's much easier to connect with others.

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:41.031
In the next video, I'll tell you what Japan does better than Korea.
